  "term": "plastic surgery",
  "definition": "In this source, plastic surgery refers to surgical work on the face in which detailed knowledge of blood vessels is important for planning tissue flap transplantation and related procedures. It is presented as a clinical area that uses anatomical information to guide facial surgical design.",
